  "goodToKnow": "Die Abstammung means descent or ancestry: deutscher Abstammung sein (to be of German descent, genitive). The verb is abstammen von: Der Mensch stammt vom Affen ab, a popular simplification of Darwin. Der Stamm means trunk, tribe and word stem. Until 2000, German citizenship was based almost entirely on descent (ius sanguinis); now children born in Germany can also become citizens. It has no plural."
